# ─── Ticketmaster Discovery API ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Free tier: 5,000 calls/day — covers concerts, sports, arts, comedy, family events
# Sign up at: https://developer.ticketmaster.com/
# After registering, create an app and copy your "Consumer Key" here.
#
# Steps:
#   1. Go to https://developer.ticketmaster.com/ → Sign Up
#   2. Click "My Apps" → Create a new app
#   3. Copy the "Consumer Key" value
#   4. Paste it below (remove the placeholder text)
#
VITE_TICKETMASTER_KEY=your_ticketmaster_consumer_key_here
